	WLR_SURFACE_STATE_VIEWPORT = 1 << 8,  // <-- Viewport commit flag
	WLR_SURFACE_STATE_OFFSET = 1 << 9,
};
```

**Access pattern:** Check `c->surface.xdg->surface->current.committed & WLR_SURFACE_STATE_VIEWPORT`

